      "text": "```\nCADENCE (stride rate):\n  Measured in steps/minute or strides/minute (strides = two steps).\n  Typical recreational runner: 160–170 steps/min.\n  Common advice: 170–180 steps/min (\"Daniels 180 rule\").\n  Elite runners: typically 185–200+ steps/min."
    },
